          "technique": "computational",
          "note": "Fig. 2d, with coordinates in Supplementary Data 1 (not read): spin-polarised DFT, RPBE with D3 dispersion in VASP, a three-layer 3 × 3 Ag(111) slab, frequencies by finite differences in ASE (±0.005 Å). The applied potential is left out of the frequency calculation, which the authors do for simplicity, so this is a zero-field value set against Stark-shifted measurements. Bridged CO calculated at 1867 cm⁻¹, against 1848 to 1757 measured. The slab carries 15 Å of vacuum and the frequency calculation no solvent."
        },
