      "description": "Four-fold hollow CO coordinated to four metal atoms at once — a comparatively rare coordination geometry, since it needs a specific square arrangement of surface atoms to form. Exhibits the lowest ν(CO) frequencies among metal-CO adsorption modes, since backdonation from four neighbors at once weakens the C-O bond more than any other coordination geometry.",
