      "short": "ν(CH) HCOO*",
      "description": "Formate C-H stretch, the key HCOO* marker and strongly site-sensitive across its window: κ²-HCOO* on metallic Cu sits near 2848 to 2860 cm⁻¹ and the same mode on a cation or oxide site 20 to 40 cm⁻¹ higher, far enough to resolve two formate populations in one spectrum. Two traps at the low end: methoxy νₛ(CH₃) on silica and adsorbed methanol νₛ(CH₃) both land there, so a band near 2850 cm⁻¹ is safely formate only once its combination band near 2930 cm⁻¹ or a deuteration check backs it up.",
