          "technique": "drifts",
          "tags": [],
          "note": "Fig. 5b, 5d and Table S5 (operando DRIFTS, 220 °C, 6 bar, 25 mL min⁻¹, switching H₂/CO₂ 3/1 → He/CO₂ 3/1), unpromoted Cu/SiO₂: ν(CH) of bidentate formate at 2890 cm⁻¹. Cutting the hydrogen stops the reaction at HCOO*, and this band grows while methoxy disappears; restoring H₂ removes it completely. Not detected at steady state, which the paper puts down to low coverage. Recorded on Cu⁰ because the paper finds the same position on CuGa(0.20) and concludes that formate sits on Cu⁰, not at the interface."
        },
