          "technique": "drifts",
          "tags": [],
          "note": "Fig. 1b (ME-DRIFTS-PSD, Cu-GaZrOₓ, 20 bar, 260 °C, CO₂ modulated at constant H₂): ν(CH) of HCOO* at 2876 cm⁻¹, responding at the modulation frequency, which is what marks it an intermediate rather than a spectator. The paper does not say where on the catalyst the formate sits. The same position on the Cu-free GaZrOₓ is a claim of its own."
