          "note": "Supplementary Note 4, Figs. S24 and S25, Table S4: SnO₂ nanoparticles cast on the Au/Si prism, CO₂-saturated 0.1 M CsHCO₃, static at −1.1 V or pulsed with E(c) = −1.1 V and E(a) = −0.35 or −0.2 V vs. RHE; the reference is the single-beam spectrum at 0.65 V before electrolysis, and the deconvolutions are the 10th cycle (t(c) = 188.3 s, t(a) = 198.3 s). An extra peak near 1675 cm⁻¹ appears only when the potential steps to either anodic value, as a shoulder on the water bend, and is assigned to the C=O stretch of monodentate formate, *OCHO(M), the intermediate to formate, matching the silver result."
