          "technique": "drifts",
          "tags": [],
          "note": "Figs. 5a, 5c, S17b and Table S5 (operando DRIFTS, CuGa(0.20), 220 °C, H₂/CO₂ = 3, 6 bar, 25 mL min⁻¹): νₐₛ(CH₃) of CH₃O* at steady state, 7 cm⁻¹ below the same mode on the unpromoted Cu/SiO₂. Methoxy is the most abundant surface intermediate here, and that shift is the paper's evidence that on the promoted catalyst it sits on the Cu⁺ site at the Cu-Ga₂O₃ interface rather than on Cu⁰ — an inference from the frequency, since the two catalysts are otherwise alike. Formate is not detected under these conditions."
