          "note": "Fig. 5a (operando DRIFTS-MS, precipitated Ga₂O₃, CO₂/H₂ = 1:3, 30 to 450 °C; Table S2): νₐₛ(CH₃) of CH₃O*, marked as a shoulder 39 cm⁻¹ below the formate combination band at 2979 cm⁻¹ and paired with νₛ(CH₃) at 2834 cm⁻¹. Methoxy on an oxide carrying no metal at all: it is made from formate by the surface Ga-H hydride, and gas-phase methanol follows it into the mass spectrometer from 304 °C (Fig. S16)."
