      "short": "ν(CO) MeOH (scaffold)",
      "description": "Methanol's second, more delocalized C-O-region fundamental (MeOH*/MeOH(g)) — mixes C-O stretching with C-O-H/O-C-H angle bending rather than being a clean bond stretch like the band below; distinguishing the two in practice relies on the C-H stretching region markers, not position alone.",
