          "note": "Table 2, vapour column of a Raman study recording vapour, liquid and argon-matrix methanol on one instrument, 515 nm, 3 W at the sample for the vapour cell. Assigned there as ν₇, a CH₃ deformation; Dinu names the same mode the C-O scaffold, which is the same mixed coordinate under two conventions. One of only two bands the vapour spectrum shows below 1600 cm⁻¹, and the paper notes it is a poorly resolved doublet. The paper's own normal-mode calculation accompanies the table; the value here is the observed vapour figure, not the calculated one."
        },
