          "note": "Table 3, ν₇(A′) νCO scaffold of CH₃OH in solid neon at 6 K; 1076.3 cm⁻¹ in argon, against 1074.5 cm⁻¹ in the gas phase. Only 72% of this mode is the C-O stretch; the rest is HOC and OCH bending, which is why methanol has two bands in this region rather than one.",
