          "wn": 1034,
          "technique": "raman",
          "tags": [],
          "note": "Table 2, vapour column of a Raman study recording vapour, liquid and argon-matrix methanol on one instrument, 515 nm, 3 W at the sample for the vapour cell. Assigned there as ν₈, the C-O stretch. The paper's own normal-mode calculation accompanies the table; the value here is the observed vapour figure, not the calculated one."
        },
        {
          "id": 323,
          "key": "AlAbdulghani.UncoveringPressureDependentMechanism.2025",
          "medium": "gas",
          "form": "free",
          "technique": "drifts",
          "tags": [],
          "note": "Fig. 1b (ME-DRIFTS-PSD, Cu-GaZrOₓ, 20 bar, 260 °C): CH₃OH(g) is followed as the product of the modulation experiment and appears in the spectra below 1100 cm⁻¹, but the paper marks it by label rather than by wavenumber, so no position is recorded here. Its phase delay behind CH₃O* is the paper's evidence that methoxy is hydrolysed to methanol rather than hydrogenated."
        },
        {
          "id": 324,
          "key": "Wu.BondingGeometryReactivity.2000",
          "medium": "vacuum",
          "form": "adsorbed",
          "measured_on": "tio2",
          "technique": "transmission",
          "tags": [
