          "wn": 1034,
          "note": "Table I, CH₃OH vapour in a 10-cm cell at 80 mmHg and room temperature: ν(CO) P/Q/R branches at 1012/1034/1060 cm⁻¹ (vs). Q branch at 1034 is the fundamental; R at 1060 cm⁻¹ coincides with the CO scaffold mode (~1074 cm⁻¹) and may cause apparent broadening on the high-frequency side.",
          "technique": "transmission",
          "tags": []
        },
