          "note": "Table 3, ν₈(A′) νCO of CH₃OH in solid neon at 6 K; 1033.9 cm⁻¹ in argon, against 1033.5 cm⁻¹ in the gas phase, the smallest matrix shift of any methanol fundamental. Despite the label it is only 41% C-O stretch, with 29% HOC and 28% OCH bending mixed in.",
          "technique": "transmission",
          "tags": []
