          "measured_on": "ga2o3",
          "technique": "drifts",
          "tags": [],
          "note": "Figs. 1 and S3 (precipitated Ga₂O₃, 0.1 MPa D₂ at 450 °C): the deuterated counterpart of the 3685 and 3532 cm⁻¹ hydroxyl pair, formed alongside the Ga-D bands. Both components are recorded on this one band because the paper reports them together and does not pair each with its own hydroxyl, though the ratios (1.37 and 1.36) follow the same order."
        }
      ],
      "intensity": "w",
      "width": "medium",
      "confidence": "confirmed",
      "tags": []
    },

