      "description": "A strong, broad band near 235 cm⁻¹ in rutile that is no lattice fundamental. Its strength had it assigned as one, but its polarisation fits none of the allowed modes and no allowed combination falls here; it is read as second-order scattering, strong in TiO₂ because its TiO₆ octahedra are very anharmonic, or as disorder-induced.",
