          "technique": "raman",
          "note": "Ch. 2.1 (Neuville, Cicconi, Blanc and Lancry, Raman spectroscopy of glass and glass fibre), pp. 107 and 113: D1 near 485-490 cm⁻¹ (495 in the list of three peaks), breathing of the oxygens, perpendicular to the Si-O-Si plane, in regular but slightly puckered four-membered rings. Absent from the VH spectra of a transversely probed fibre (p. 117).",
          "tags": []
